<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>VAZQZ — Under the Shadow of the Almighty</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --shadow: #0a0a0f;
            --deep-shadow: #050508;
            --light: #f0f0f5;
            --muted: #6b6b7b;
            --cyan: #00f0ff;
            --gold: #ffd700;
        }

        body {
            background: var(--deep-shadow);
            color: var(--light);
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .verse {
            font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 28px);
            font-style: italic;
            max-width: 700px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: var(--light);
        }

        .reference {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .logo {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            animation: breathe 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes breathe {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.6; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        .cta {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--cyan);
            color: var(--cyan);
            padding: 16px 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .cta:hover {
            background: var(--cyan);
            color: var(--deep-shadow);
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .tagline {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-top: 80px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="logo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none">
            <rect width="80" height="80" rx="20" fill="#0a0a0f" stroke="rgba(0,240,255,0.3)" stroke-width="1"/>
            <path d="M20 60L40 20L60 60" stroke="#00f0ff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="40" cy="52" r="3" fill="#00f0ff"/>
        </svg>
    </div>

    <p class="verse">
        "He who dwells in the secret place of the Most High<br>
        shall abide under the shadow of the Almighty."
    </p>
    <p class="reference">Psalm 91:1</p>

    <p class="verse" style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 500px;">
        The TypeScript toolkit for developers who build<br>
        not by sight, but by faith. Zero-config. Fully protected.<br>
        AI-powered. Covenant-secured.
    </p>

    <a href="#install" class="cta">Enter the Secret Place</a>

    <p class="tagline">23,91 / 1%</p>

</body>
</html>
